                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b2ff76ac-e62a-341a-b381-00c8165dc029",
                        "entry_id": "3bff08ad-4a47-3442-ab03-26a569271eb0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. небольшое отделение в автомобиле около щита управления для хранения мелких подручных инструментов и личных вещей водителя"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdf8e35b-0dfb-42b9-b13b-ae169f8f3804",
                                "sense_id": "b2ff76ac-e62a-341a-b381-00c8165dc029",
                                "text": "Я и говорю: «Не дело, робята, в дороге выпивать, не доехать нам живыми», а шофёр уж стакан достал из ящичка, что бардачком-то прозывается."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ea27633-2a12-4d37-977e-917be7969057",
                                "sense_id": "b2ff76ac-e62a-341a-b381-00c8165dc029",
                                "text": "Есть у меня в «бардачке» и перчатки — для работы с машиной, если вдруг поломка."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5b3f8069-4a72-4789-8605-36ab399cf6e6",
                        "source_entry_id": "3bff08ad-4a47-3442-ab03-26a569271eb0",
                        "source_sense_id": "b2ff76ac-e62a-341a-b381-00c8165dc029",
                        "target_lang_word": "glove compartment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "glove compartment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ca1b317-98fc-37b1-90ce-d45c7df1be66",
                                        "entry_id": "4eb12efd-b831-3531-8def-b1a83095c5b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A compartment recessed in an automobile’s dashboard, that usually has a door and can be locked, intended to hold gloves, papers, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "316c947b-aba0-4ff2-9522-d71daf8f349e",
                                                "sense_id": "7ca1b317-98fc-37b1-90ce-d45c7df1be66",
                                                "text": "Such was my enthusiasm to get there, I probably went faster than was prudent over such a dodgy road, but by the time I arrived the only damage was that the glove compartment had rattled loose."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e948ae73-329a-4493-a393-240527ed32e5",
                        "source_entry_id": "3bff08ad-4a47-3442-ab03-26a569271eb0",
                        "source_sense_id": "b2ff76ac-e62a-341a-b381-00c8165dc029",
                        "target_lang_word": "glove box",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "glove box",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bef78795-7502-3cd3-9284-2bfee57e8efd",
                                        "entry_id": "72d5ce71-4ed3-33e7-81a7-f639b4bb6d12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small compartment with a door on the dashboard of a car, usually on passenger side, used to store (and sometimes lock) items."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17fec7c7-5e4f-4df0-8f1a-7d63d27d5abb",
                                                "sense_id": "bef78795-7502-3cd3-9284-2bfee57e8efd",
                                                "text": "There's a map in the glovebox."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0205d3b8-8058-4b5b-8861-6649407f8c63",
                                                "sense_id": "bef78795-7502-3cd3-9284-2bfee57e8efd",
                                                "text": "So I went for the shotgun in the Hilux, but could only find one rat-shot shell in the glove box."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b233b4a3-c2d7-3120-818f-2a4dc84f9121",
                                        "entry_id": "72d5ce71-4ed3-33e7-81a7-f639b4bb6d12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A plastic box or similar enclosure containing a controlled environment, with rubber gloves fastened around holes in the front of the box through which a person can manipulate things in the box without introducing outside contamination; an isolator."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "abd02c64-c473-495e-8e7d-97af56a198d1",
